{
  "__comment": "Closed cube shell, 4 cells per face. Every face is declared on its inward side so the shell renders from inside a backface-culled item pipeline, and every wall sits just outside the cube so its visible face lands exactly on the cube surface - adjacent walls then share their edge exactly and leave no seam. item.vsh reduces these vertices to directions and draws them at infinity; the cube only exists to span every direction.",
